sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in Crime No. 147/2023 of Kirugavalu Police Station registered for the offences punishable under Sections 498A, 504, 323, 302 read with Section 34 of IPC, subject to the following conditions:
NC: 2025:KHC:10391 a) Petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future;
 e) The petitioner shall not leave the  jurisdiction of the Trial Court without Mahadeva @ Lingaraju vs The State Of Karnataka on 12 March, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/108724952/
3 permission of the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
Sd/-
(S VISHWAJITH SHETTY) JUDGE LRS Mahadeva @ Lingaraju vs The State Of Karnataka on 12 March, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/108724952/
